- My opinion – it’s gonna
be the answer of Alex.

00:19:24.386 --> 00:19:25.579
- Tram.

00:19:26.706 --> 00:19:28.225
- Trammm.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:31.546
- So, tram is the cheapest
you think? Both agree?

00:19:31.631 --> 00:19:32.487
- Yeah.

00:19:32.572 --> 00:19:33.424
- Good.

00:19:33.509 --> 00:19:35.223
- After – I’ll put the bus.

00:19:35.308 --> 00:19:36.359
- Bus! Yeah.

