00:19:37.841 --> 00:19:38.894
- Bus.

00:19:41.262 --> 00:19:42.136
- A bus.

00:19:42.221 --> 00:19:44.610
- Next one – a taxi.

00:19:45.293 --> 00:19:46.301
- Yeah.

00:19:46.386 --> 00:19:47.236
- Sure?

00:19:47.451 --> 00:19:49.360
- I think…

00:19:49.445 --> 00:19:53.486
- Okay. Taxi.

00:19:55.289 --> 00:19:57.752
- After – it can be…

00:19:57.837 --> 00:19:58.875
- Train.

00:19:59.183 --> 00:20:00.514
- Train. Okay.

00:20:03.468 --> 00:20:08.452
- So, to have a trip on a ship,
maybe it can be expensive.

00:20:08.548 --> 00:20:11.825
But what is about motorcycle?

00:20:12.063 --> 00:20:13.859
