- Думаєш так?...

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:30.204
- … To buy a ticket – it
can be cheap. Right?

00:20:30.289 --> 00:20:34.643
- Okay. Ship. Let’s put a ship.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:38.905
- Next one is the ship. Okay, ship.

00:20:39.738 --> 00:20:43.308
- After – let’s put as low-cost plane.

00:20:45.085 --> 00:20:46.328
Can be.

00:20:46.413 --> 00:20:49.839
Because I think helicopter
is the most expensive to get.

00:20:49.924 --> 00:20:51.328
- Yeah. Okay.

00:20:51.437 --> 00:20:56.905
- Let’s put the… yeah, plane.
After – motorcycle to buy.

00:20:58.119 --> 00:21:02.433
- Motorcycle to buy, not
the petrol. Motorcycle to buy.

00:21:02.518 --> 00:21:06.593
- To buy. Yes, to buy a motorcycle.

00:21:06.678 --> 00:21:08.571
- And the most expensive?

00:21:08.656 --> 00:21:10.254
- The helicopter.

00:21:14.524 --> 00:21:17.727
- Helicopter. Would you
like to use a helicopter?

00:21:17.812 --> 00:21:19.241
- Yeah, I would love to.

00:21:19.326 --> 00:21:23.103
- What about you, Alex? Have
you ever? Or a private tram for you?

00:21:23.188 --> 00:21:25.357
- Tram is disgusting.

00:21:25.556 --> 00:21:26.943
- Disgusting, agree.

00:21:27.103 --> 00:21:29.159
Actually, tram is very limited.

00:21:29.252 --> 00:21:30.590
